$5000
[
[ TEST FOR THE LASER MODULATION LOOP
[ USES DAC X TO SET MULT LEVEL
[ USES DAC Y TO PULSE
[ USES ADC 12 TO SAMPLE
[
[ THIS ROUTINE DISPLAYS 
[ RESULT IN LINC AC
[ STORES ALL VALUES IN FIELD 1
[ FOR LATER ANALYSIS
[
[ RIGHT SW IS DAC X VOLTAGE
[ LEFT SW IS INTRA-PULSE DELAY
[
[ ASSUME LMB = 2
[ THIS MUST BE STARTED 
[ WITH PDP START SW
DACX=6361
DACY=6362
HLT  [ START FROM HERE
CDF 10
CLA
DCA DATA
TAD LPGM
ISSP  [ LINC PROGRAM
CLA
TAD L10
ICON  [ SPRING TO LIFE
TAD L2
ICON
NOP
[
[ START WITH DACX LEVEL
#BEGIN  LAS
DACX
CLA
[
[ WAIT LEFT SW TIME
ILES
SNA
JMP GO  [ SW = ZERO
CIA
DCA TOCK
TAD TICKX
DCA TICK
ISZ TICK
JMP p-1
ISZ TOCK
JMP p-3
/T
[
[ PUT THE PULSE UP FOR A BIT
#GO   TAD UP
DACY
CLA
TAD TICKX
DCA TICK
ISZ TICK
JMP p-1
[
[ START LINC TO READ A TO D
TAD L12
ICON
CLA
IAAC
DCAi DATA
ISZ DATA
NOP
[
[ PULSE DOWN AND GO BACK
TAD DOWN
DACY
CLA
JMP BEGIN
/T
[ CONSTANTS
#UP  1000
#DOWN 0
#TICKX -300
#TICK 0
#TOCK 0
#L12  12
#L10  10
#L2   2
#LPGM 1200
#DATA 0
[
